WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.518
Narrator: When your team is with a client, the next booking can still start with a conversation.

00:00:04.898 --> 00:00:10.735
Narrator: An AI assistant gathers the service request and customer details, then checks the configured schedule.

00:00:11.115 --> 00:00:15.527
Narrator: The booking workflow can create the appointment on the staff and master Google calendars.

00:00:15.907 --> 00:00:23.671
Narrator: SMS delivers the appointment details and the next step, such as a deposit link. A pending deposit is tracked separately from payment.

00:00:24.051 --> 00:00:30.905
Narrator: Your team sees the service, assigned staff member, appointment time, source and deposit status in one dashboard.

00:00:31.285 --> 00:00:35.622
Narrator: Requests that need a person can move to a human assistance or callback workflow.

00:00:36.002 --> 00:00:39.820
Narrator: This is a fictional walkthrough. Let's map the workflow for your business.

